  data:
    Id: ashen_reckoning
    DisplayName: Ashen Reckoning
    Description: Needs a **Poisoned** target. Remove its Poison and deal 150% of the damage it had left as {poison} and {fire} damage, then make it **Vulnerable** (+20% damage taken) for 1 turn. Costs 10 {mana}. {cooldown} 2.
